{"cast":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/vmHMnZ1RQNBP0wvkF453qYMIjNb.jpg","genre_ids":[35,18],"id":67415,"title":"지리멸렬","original_language":"ko","original_title":"지리멸렬","overview":"","popularity":1.0245,"poster_path":"/bMzzaJegc6JbBDJulQUhUNxSd6K.jpg","release_date":"2025-08-27","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.333,"vote_count":6,"character":"Paperboy's Brother","credit_id":"645bde03156cc700ffa8e544","order":9},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/2VbPypoIBkomTTs7tBsp4uMaxrp.jpg","genre_ids":[878,18,10752,35,14],"id":118624,"title":"Księga Zagłady","original_language":"ko","original_title":"인류멸망보고서","overview":"Antologia Science Fiction prosto z Korei.\r W \"Nowym Wspaniałym Świecie\", wirus sprowadza na Seul apokalipsę zombi.\r W \"Boskim Stworzeniu\" robot pracujący w świątyni nieoczekiwanie osiąga stan  oświecenia, a jego twórcy uznają go za zagrożenie dla gatunku ludzkiego.\r W ostatniej historii, zatytułowanej \"Sto lat!\", młoda dziewczyna zamawia na tajemniczej stronie internetowej kulę bilardową dla swojego ojca. Wkrótce okazuje się, że na ziemię zmierza meteoryt i ludzie ratują się ucieczką do podziemnych bunkrów.","popularity":1.7361,"poster_path":"/qBhpoud9ujS53vk70LiCHhYDVct.jpg","release_date":"2012-04-11","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.154,"vote_count":115,"character":"Lee Joon-ho","credit_id":"52fe4bdfc3a36847f821761b","order":5},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":967309,"title":"Making Memories of Murder","original_language":"ko","original_title":"Making Memories of Murder","overview":"","popularity":0.7614,"poster_path":"/3KJ9o6svlHhmcT7Ds4p3USF8nVu.jpg","release_date":"2005-08-09","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":0.0,"vote_count":0,"character":"Self","credit_id":"626632d56eecee30f0dda694","order":0},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"genre_ids":[99],"id":998169,"title":"Memories","original_language":"ko","original_title":"Memories","overview":"","popularity":0.4153,"poster_path":"/w